                           <h1 class="display-4">Office of the University Registrar</h1>
                           			
                           <p class="lead pb-3 font-weight-light">The Office of the University Registrar includes registration services for current
                              students, student records, Undergraduate Degree Evaluations, Veterans Services Office,
                              as well as Transfer Credit &amp; Articulation.  Our friendly staff is available virtually
                              during regular business hours to assist you with any questions or concerns you may
                              have.</p>
